Browse the data dictionary catalog

Usage: vendo dictionary [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list    List catalog definitions (events by default)
  search  Search one subject type by text in subject ID, name and description
  get     Look up one catalog definition by the subject ID from list or search, or an alias such as event:<name>
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help            Print help
